            "review_title": "Review at Le Tongking - Goc Bac",
            "review_text": "Jullian Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n2\nAsk them for a full set. It’s fantastic.\nSep 2019 • Friends\nThey dont show in menu but you can ask for one set of traditional stuff like this. Gorgeous!\n\nThere are millet rice crackers as your order, one bowl of porridge (rice, black beans, mung beans, red beans and lotus seeds mixed), mung bean cake, pork biscuit, “banh khao” and sweet sunflower seed.\n\nThey will give you lotus tea for free.\n\nBtw, the best thing here is coconut millet rice cracker.\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
