            "review_title": "Review at Le Tongking - Goc Bac",
            "review_text": "Tom C\nHanoi, Vietnam37 contributions\n2\nA hidden gem in Hanoi where you can find the elusive \"banh da ke\" (millet rice cracker)\nSep 2019 • Friends\n\"Banh da ke\" (rice cracker with millet inside) is a traditional snack food where you can usually find in traveling street food vendors. Now there is a shop for this! It's a fun way to enjoy the city sitting outside on the street eating snacks watching the city come alive. Right in the Old Quarter, definitely a must try for Hanoi lovers.\nWritten September 21, 2019",
